Package: dictacode-hid
Version: 0.2.4
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: dictacode-core
Depends: python3, python3-venv, python3-systemd, systemd
Maintainer: Christian Prior-Mamulyan <cprior@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cprima-homelab/dictacode
Description: dictacode USB HID keyboard gadget
 Configures a Raspberry Pi Zero as a USB HID keyboard device.
 .
 This package:
  - Configures boot parameters for USB gadget mode (dwc2)
  - Installs a systemd service to create the HID gadget at boot
  - Creates /dev/hidg0 for keyboard emulation
  - Provides UART-to-HID bridge for receiving text from STT
 .
 Requirements:
  - Raspberry Pi Zero / Zero W / Zero 2 W (OTG capable)
  - Reboot required after first install
